  "dataNotes": [
    "Courses, credit hours and prerequisites come from the study plan. Suggested semesters come from the guidance plan.",
    "The guidance plan includes Science and Life (0201111) in Year 3, Semester 1, which is not part of the Computer Science study plan, and does not list Introduction to Artificial Intelligence (0114208). UniPath follows the study plan, so Introduction to Artificial Intelligence has no suggested semester.",
    "The guidance plan puts Computer Networks (0102450) in the same semester as its prerequisite Computer Organization (0102240). UniPath does not assume a prerequisite can be taken at the same time, so it plans Computer Networks for a later semester.",
    "The guidance plan calls 0107200 \"Discrete Structures\"; the study plan calls it \"Discrete Mathematics\". UniPath uses the study-plan title.",
    "Courses listed as (3,1,3) are counted as 3 credit hours, which matches the plan's section totals.",
    "CS Capstone Project 1 also needs department approval. UniPath shows this but cannot check it."
  ],
